.TH TDE\-YOUTUBE 1 "November 2026" "tde-youtube 0.2.0" "Trinity Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
tde\-youtube \- browse, search and play YouTube videos on the Trinity Desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tde\-youtube
.RB [ \-s | \-\-search
.IR query ]
.RI [ URL ]
.RI [ "generic TDE options" ]
.RI [ "generic TQt options" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tde\-youtube
(TDE YouTube) is a native application for the Trinity Desktop Environment
(TDE) for searching, browsing and watching YouTube videos without a web
browser.
.PP
Search results are shown with thumbnails, duration, channel and view count.
Videos play inside the main window in an embedded
.BR mpv (1)
player, or optionally in a separate mpv window.
Videos can be kept as favourites, and a history of watched videos is kept.
The full description, likes and upload date of a video are shown next to the
player.
.PP
tde\-youtube does not access YouTube itself:
.BR yt\-dlp (1)
is used to search and to read information about videos, channels and
playlists, and
.BR mpv (1)
plays the videos. No YouTube account or API key is required.
.PP
The complete documentation is available as the
.I TDE YouTube Handbook
in the TDE Help Center
.RB ( "khelpcenter help:/tde\-youtube" ),
or by pressing F1 in the application.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-s, \-\-search " query
Search YouTube for
.I query
on start\-up.
.TP
.I URL
Open the address of a YouTube video, playlist or channel.
A single video starts playing immediately; the videos of a playlist or
channel are listed.
.SS Generic options
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help about options.
.TP
.B \-\-help\-qt
Show TQt specific options.
.TP
.B \-\-help\-tde
Show TDE specific options.
.TP
.B \-\-help\-all
Show all options.
.TP
.B \-\-author
Show author information.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version information.
.TP
.B \-\-license
Show license information.
.TP
.BI \-\-geometry " geometry"
Set the initial geometry of the main window.
.TP
.BI \-\-caption " caption"
Use
.I caption
as the name in the title bar.
.TP
.BI \-\-icon " icon"
Use
.I icon
as the application icon.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
All shortcuts can be changed with
.IR "Settings \(-> Configure Shortcuts" .
.TP 18
.B Ctrl+F
Focus the search box.
.TP
.B Enter
Search (in the search box) or play the selected video (in a list).
.TP
.B Ctrl+M
Load more search results.
.TP
.B Ctrl+O
Open the address of a video, playlist or channel.
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Play the selected video.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+P
Play the selected video in a separate mpv window.
.TP
.B Space
Pause or resume playback.
.TP
.B Ctrl+.
Stop playback.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+Left ", " Ctrl+Right
Skip ten seconds backward or forward.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+Up ", " Ctrl+Down
Change the volume.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+F
Toggle full screen mode
.RB ( Esc
leaves it).
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
Add the selected video to the favourites, or remove it.
.TP
.B Del
Remove the selected video from the favourites or history list.
.TP
.B Ctrl+U
List the videos of the selected video's channel.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+C
Copy the address of the selected video.
.TP
.B Ctrl+B
Open the selected video in the web browser.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+1 ", " Ctrl+2 ", " Ctrl+3
Show the Search, Favourites or History list.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.trinity/share/config/tde\-youtuberc
Settings: paths of yt\-dlp and mpv, video quality, cookies, search history and window layout.
.TP
.I ~/.trinity/share/config/tde\-youtube\-libraryrc
Favourites and watch history.
.TP
.I ~/.trinity/share/cache/tde\-youtube/thumbs/
Cached video thumbnails.
.PP
.I ~/.trinity
is the default value of
.BR $TDEHOME .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TDEHOME
Location of the user's TDE configuration (default
.IR ~/.trinity ).
.TP
.B PATH
Used to find
.B yt\-dlp
and
.B mpv
unless full paths are configured.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.TP
.B yt\-dlp
Required for searching and for playback. By default tde\-youtube downloads
the official portable yt\-dlp from github.com/yt\-dlp into
.I ~/.trinity/share/apps/tde\-youtube/bin/
and keeps it up to date; this needs
.B python3
3.10 or newer. An installed yt\-dlp is used when this is turned off under
.IR "Settings \(-> Configure TDE YouTube \(-> Programs" .
.TP
.B QuickJS
JavaScript engine that yt\-dlp needs to solve YouTube's challenges.
tde\-youtube downloads QuickJS\-ng from github.com/quickjs\-ng into the same
folder; otherwise an installed deno or
.B qjs
is used.
.TP
.B mpv
Required for playback; version 0.35 or newer is recommended.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
If YouTube answers
.I "Sign in to confirm you're not a bot"
choose a web browser in which you are signed in to YouTube under
.IR "Settings \(-> Configure TDE YouTube \(-> Programs \(-> Cookies" ,
so that yt\-dlp can use its cookies.
.PP
If searching or playing stops working, update yt\-dlp first.
